          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.214,
            0.833,
            0.257
          ],
          "content": "2. What is the sum of the smallest and largest 5-digit palindrome? What is their difference?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.264,
            0.833,
            0.308
          ],
          "content": "3. The time now is 10:01. How many minutes until the clock shows the next palindromic time? What about the one after that?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.313,
            0.834,
            0.355
          ],
          "content": "4. How many rounds does the number 5683 take to reach the Kaprekar constant?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.372,
            0.356,
            0.396
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "3.8 Mental Math"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.415,
            0.833,
            0.458
          ],
          "content": "Observe the figure below. What can you say about the numbers and the lines drawn?"
